Entries for the Nebraska QSO Party used by in-state stations
The 93 Nebraska counties (each its own multiplier) + 50 states + 13 Canadian provinces and territories.
DXCC entities are the DX multiplier. NF and LB are read as NL (the last line).
The county file comes FIRST and maps no county to Ne, so each county keeps its own multiplier.
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.
https://nebraskaqsoparty.com

INCLUDE FILE nebraska_cty.dom
INCLUDE FILE S50.DOM
INCLUDE FILE P13.DOM
Nl = NF,LB
